{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1443604-technocratic-seeking-suggestions","id":1443604,"title":"Technocratic Seeking Suggestions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-12T09:23:51-07:00","id":1443604,"title":"Technocratic Seeking Suggestions","content":"I'm trying to come up with some ideas for Technocratic Seekings, but I'm hitting a mental block where whatever I kick around in my head seems too. . . <i>Superstitionist</i>. I would appreciate hearing the Collective's brainstorms of various Technocratic Seekings. Please &amp; Thank You! :^)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Outpost Phoenix</a>, an Non-Affiliated, Live-Action Star Trek <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zwnyzm\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> Sim. New players are always welcome!","edited":{"userid":11235,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","user":"Arzie","date":". 04-12-2021, 12:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","name":"Arzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T10:12:07-07:00","id":1443609,"title":"","content":"A hooded stranger pulls the Technocrat into an alley (or a dark corner of a Construct), whispers &quot;<i>Just don't let anyone know that I gave this to you, they might even get to me if you'll let them have it. Good luck, seeing you again.</i>&quot; and gives the Technocrat a fat folder of documents before disappearing. The documents are intricate and challenging, and cover many topics - Enlightened Science, her paradigm, outlooks, opinions about friends and co-workers, the society etc. The folder is so obviously personal that only a soulmate or a twin (or an Avatar) could have written it. By following what is written inside and applying it to her thinking and her Enlightened Science, she can reach new heights of understanding and achievement.<br /> <br /> If the Technocrat decides to share the folder with anyone else, the Seeking is failed and the folder turns out to be filled with very dreary observations about mundane science. She might get another chance at such a Seeking later.<br /> As long as the Technocrat keeps the folder to herself, the folder can't be found and accessed by anyone else. (Maybe barring extraordinary and potent use of Magick to track it.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3254,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","user":"Muad'Dib","date":". 04-12-2021, 01:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T10:17:17-07:00","id":1443610,"title":"","content":"Seekings are always going to be specific to the individual but some general ideas for inspiration: the epiphany that the detective uses to solve a case in a mystery show, the feeling of solving a mathematics or logic problem, the \u2018eureka!\u2019 feeling; search for the moment of insight that lets the character put a bunch of pieces together to see a larger picture.<br /> <br /> Also keep in mind the phase of Awakening they\u2019re on. While this will vary table to table I have 1-5 represent a further understanding of their paradigm and 6-10 a gradual realization of the insignificance of their paradigm, as a loose rule-of-thumb.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T11:29:14-07:00","id":1443621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arzie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1443604-technocratic-seeking-suggestions#post1443604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm trying to come up with some ideas for Technocratic Seekings, but I'm hitting a mental block where whatever I kick around in my head seems too. . . <i>Superstitionist</i>. I would appreciate hearing the Collective's brainstorms of various Technocratic Seekings. Please &amp; Thank You! :^)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> - exploring a scientific theory in an interesting metaphoric way in a dream<br /> - summoned by an unknown higher ranking official to a debriefing room where there are slides of past mistakes the Technocrat is forced to explain and review and address their flaws. Later any investigation will fail to identify the official debriefing them<br /> - summoned to a room with no one in it but a puzzle box they need to use enlightened science tools in the room to solve<br /> - a running series of dreams reflecting key moments in the Union's history to gradually reveal how it's been corrupted from its ideals and thus gradually guide the Technocrat into being a reformer if not rebel","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T16:36:33-07:00","id":1443670,"title":"","content":"Even technocrats have dreams. They see them differently. A Hermetic and a Progenitor could have highly similar dreams which both understand as important to their development. The Hermetic sees the dream as a vision from their genius or deamon. The Progenitor assumes that their subconscious mind is helping them resolve a difficulty. ItX guys already think of their brains as biological computers, the dream would simply be a subroutine in his brain bringing matterial they don't fully understand to the conscious minds attention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-14T18:06:36-07:00","id":1443962,"title":"","content":"An AI has written a novel, as per its design. It's terrible. Help it learn to write a better one before it is deleted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":26467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","user":"HorizonParty2021","date":". 04-15-2021, 02:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T19:02:00-07:00","id":1445394,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the late reply. I'm moving house from across the Atlantic. Thank you all for your suggestions. They're most appreciated and will help me with a starting point!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Outpost Phoenix</a>, an Non-Affiliated, Live-Action Star Trek <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zwnyzm\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> Sim. New players are always welcome!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","name":"Arzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}